WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.187 --> 00:00:03.164
(audience cheering)

2
00:00:03.164 --> 00:00:05.581
(jazz music)

3
00:00:34.093 --> 00:00:36.093
(drums)

4
00:00:39.491 --> 00:00:41.158
Thank you so much!

5
00:00:44.237 --> 00:00:45.661
Thank you very much!

6
00:00:45.661 --> 00:00:47.875
Welcome to Comic Con!

7
00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:50.875
(audience cheering)

8
00:00:55.181 --> 00:00:56.947
We have an amazing show for you tonight.

9
00:00:56.947 --> 00:00:58.557
This is our third year.

10
00:00:58.557 --> 00:00:59.390
[Andy] Yes.

11
00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:00.223
Here.

12
00:01:03.053 --> 00:01:04.643
Third year here.

13
00:01:04.643 --> 00:01:08.365
Let me start by promising that tonight

14
00:01:08.365 --> 00:01:11.171
there will be no Ed Sheeran cameo.

15
00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:12.227
That is my promise to you.

16
00:01:12.227 --> 00:01:15.227
(audience cheering)

17
00:01:19.757 --> 00:01:21.357
(laughs)

18
00:01:21.357 --> 00:01:22.797
'Course I'm talking about Game of Thrones.

19
00:01:22.797 --> 00:01:25.037
Game of Thrones returned on Sunday.

20
00:01:25.037 --> 00:01:28.909
Fans were upset that there was a cameo by Ed Sheeran.

21
00:01:28.909 --> 00:01:30.339
Yes!

22
00:01:30.339 --> 00:01:32.829
Yes, even worse, next week's episode of Game of Thrones

23
00:01:32.829 --> 00:01:34.717
is called The Biebering.

24
00:01:34.717 --> 00:01:38.342
(audience laughs)

25
00:01:38.342 --> 00:01:39.175
That's not a good sign.

26
00:01:39.175 --> 00:01:41.064
(audience cheers)

27
00:01:41.064 --> 00:01:42.981
That's not a good sign.

28
00:01:44.168 --> 00:01:45.768
As you know, I was at Comic Con last year

29
00:01:45.768 --> 00:01:48.323
and last year there were a bunch of movies

30
00:01:48.323 --> 00:01:50.872
about a dreary dystopian future.

31
00:01:50.872 --> 00:01:51.705
Yeah.

32
00:01:51.705 --> 00:01:53.277
Turns out they were documentaries.

33
00:01:53.277 --> 00:01:55.624
(audience laughs)

34
00:01:55.624 --> 00:01:56.792
That's one--

35
00:01:56.792 --> 00:01:59.371
(audience cheers)

36
00:01:59.371 --> 00:02:00.204
No!

37
00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:02.287
(laughs)

38
00:02:03.328 --> 00:02:05.392
Don't applaud that one, we're really screwed right now.

39
00:02:05.392 --> 00:02:06.278
(audience laughs)

40
00:02:06.278 --> 00:02:08.660
They're like (laughs).

41
00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.820
(groans)

42
00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:13.284
Lots of special events taking place in honor of Comic Con.

43
00:02:13.284 --> 00:02:14.889
Yesterday at the San Diego library

44
00:02:14.889 --> 00:02:17.435
there was a Quidditch tournament.

45
00:02:17.435 --> 00:02:18.268
Yeah!

46
00:02:18.268 --> 00:02:19.101
(audience cheers)

47
00:02:19.101 --> 00:02:19.934
Yeah.

48
00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:20.767
Yes! Yes!

49
00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:22.745
And trust me, when a bunch of adults get together

50
00:02:22.745 --> 00:02:25.412
to play Quidditch, there are no winners.

51
00:02:25.412 --> 00:02:27.556
(audience laughs)

52
00:02:27.556 --> 00:02:29.124
I like that there were people,

53
00:02:29.124 --> 00:02:32.276
I'm sorry, there was a whole section that was so happy.

54
00:02:32.276 --> 00:02:34.036
(laughs)

55
00:02:34.036 --> 00:02:36.265
Conan likes Quidditch!

56
00:02:36.265 --> 00:02:37.932
Why would he say it?

57
00:02:38.878 --> 00:02:40.905
Right now they're hiding their brooms.

58
00:02:40.905 --> 00:02:42.313
[Conan] I know.

59
00:02:42.313 --> 00:02:43.476
Sliding them under.

60
00:02:43.476 --> 00:02:44.921
It's expensive to be here.

61
00:02:44.921 --> 00:02:45.806
Isn't it expensive?

62
00:02:45.806 --> 00:02:46.639
It is expensive.

63
00:02:46.639 --> 00:02:47.472
(audience cheers)

64
00:02:47.472 --> 00:02:48.305
Yeah.

65
00:02:48.305 --> 00:02:49.138
This is an interesting fact,

66
00:02:49.138 --> 00:02:53.055
the average cost to attend Comic Con is $1,603.

67
00:02:54.244 --> 00:02:55.385
Yeah.

68
00:02:55.385 --> 00:02:57.161
Which, coincidentally, is the exact amount of money

69
00:02:57.161 --> 00:02:59.337
that Transformers took in last weekend.

70
00:02:59.337 --> 00:03:02.170
(audience laughs)

71
00:03:06.983 --> 00:03:09.983
(audience cheering)

72
00:03:14.265 --> 00:03:16.244
I just turned into a Chevrolet right there.

73
00:03:16.244 --> 00:03:17.492
Yeah.

74
00:03:17.492 --> 00:03:19.940
By the way, I gotta mention this, in the new Transformers 5,

75
00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:23.508
they open with the Transformers in the distant past.

76
00:03:23.508 --> 00:03:24.341
I don't know if you saw that.

77
00:03:24.341 --> 00:03:25.176
Yeah, distant past.

78
00:03:25.176 --> 00:03:26.995
Unfortunately, not far enough in the past to stop

79
00:03:26.995 --> 00:03:29.939
the meeting where they decided to make Transformers 5.

80
00:03:29.939 --> 00:03:31.016
(audience laughs)

81
00:03:31.016 --> 00:03:32.323
It was the only flaw.

82
00:03:32.323 --> 00:03:35.323
(audience cheering)

